    "<p><label>En anglais (si tu sais, sinon laisse vide) <input id=\"cl-en\" maxlength=\"140\" lang=\"en\"></label></p>":["<p><label>In English (if you know, otherwise leave empty) <input id=\"cl-en\" maxlength=\"140\" lang=\"en\"></label></p>","<p><label>En inglés (si sabes; si no, déjalo vacío) <input id=\"cl-en\" maxlength=\"140\" lang=\"en\"></label></p>","<p><label>Auf Englisch (wenn du es weißt, sonst leer lassen) <input id=\"cl-en\" maxlength=\"140\" lang=\"en\"></label></p>","<p><label>In inglese (se lo sai, altrimenti lascia vuoto) <input id=\"cl-en\" maxlength=\"140\" lang=\"en\"></label></p>","<p><label>Em inglês (se souberes; senão, deixa vazio) <input id=\"cl-en\" maxlength=\"140\" lang=\"en\"></label></p>"],
