    "<main class=\"coin-anglais coin-sciences\"><h2>🚀 Le labo des sciences</h2><p class=\"pieges-intro\">Planètes, fusées, corps humain, médecine. Ici, les mauvaises réponses se font démonter… mais les explications restent sérieuses.</p>":["<main class=\"coin-anglais coin-sciences\"><h2>🚀 The science lab</h2><p class=\"pieges-intro\">Planets, rockets, human body, medicine. Here wrong answers get roasted… but the explanations stay serious.</p>","<main class=\"coin-anglais coin-sciences\"><h2>🚀 El laboratorio de ciencias</h2><p class=\"pieges-intro\">Planetas, cohetes, cuerpo humano, medicina. Aquí las respuestas falladas reciben lo suyo… pero las explicaciones son serias.</p>","<main class=\"coin-anglais coin-sciences\"><h2>🚀 Das Wissenschaftslabor</h2><p class=\"pieges-intro\">Planeten, Raketen, menschlicher Körper, Medizin. Hier werden falsche Antworten auseinandergenommen… aber die Erklärungen bleiben ernst.</p>","<main class=\"coin-anglais coin-sciences\"><h2>🚀 Il laboratorio di scienze</h2><p class=\"pieges-intro\">Pianeti, razzi, corpo umano, medicina. Qui le risposte sbagliate vengono smontate… ma le spiegazioni restano serie.</p>","<main class=\"coin-anglais coin-sciences\"><h2>🚀 O laboratório de ciências</h2><p class=\"pieges-intro\">Planetas, foguetões, corpo humano, medicina. Aqui as respostas erradas levam com tudo… mas as explicações são sérias.</p>"],
